Subject: [PATCH] Harden security: proxy AI calls, add Firestore rules, remove
 Coach X leftovers

- Move Gemini calls behind an authenticated Cloudflare Worker (worker/);
  the app no longer reads or bundles a Gemini API key
- Add firestore.rules / storage.rules / firebase.json (owner-only user data,
  admin-only workout library, sanctioned follow + share + import writes)
- Stop writing user emails to the world-readable leaderboard (self-cleans
  existing rows); use 'Athlete' instead of email prefix as display name
- Remove Coach X mentions from Terms, Privacy and PWA manifest shortcuts
- Add .env.example; harden .gitignore (.env.*, .DS_Store, .wrangler)

